
<div class="dark" style="width:1240px;height:1080px;background:var(--s0);color:var(--fg);padding:28px 32px">

  <div style="margin-bottom:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600">The inspector, on demand</div>
  <div style="color:var(--fg-2);max-width:760px;margin-bottom:24px">It stops holding a column of the window open all day. Nothing is selected &rarr; nothing is shown. One cell selected &rarr; one line. Ask for the row &rarr; it takes real room, over the table rather than beside it.</div>

  <!-- ---------- 1. resting ---------- -->
  <div class="row" style="gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px">
    <span class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3)">1 &nbsp;Resting</span>
    <span style="color:var(--fg-2)">a selected cell is one 30&nbsp;px line under the table &mdash; no pane, no divider to mind</span>
  </div>
  <div style="width:1160px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:26px">
    <table style="border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%">
      <tr style="height:30px"><td class="meta num" style="width:52px;padding:0 10px;text-align:right;color:var(--fg-3);background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">2</td><td style="width:200px;padding:0 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">BRAZIL</td><td class="num" style="width:130px;padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">601077</td><td class="num" style="width:190px;padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">9087445021.08</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"></td></tr>
      <tr style="height:30px"><td class="meta num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;color:var(--fg-3);background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">3</td><td style="padding:0 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">CANADA</td><td class="num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">600288</td><td class="num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--accent-bg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent-line)">9070154776.62</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"></td></tr>
      <tr style="height:30px"><td class="meta num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;color:var(--fg-3);background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">4</td><td style="padding:0 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">CHINA</td><td class="num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">599940</td><td class="num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">9065000021.14</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"></td></tr>
      <tr style="height:30px"><td class="meta num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;color:var(--fg-3);background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">5</td><td style="padding:0 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">EGYPT</td><td class="num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">600116</td><td class="num" style="padding:0 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">9059116774.02</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"></td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="row" style="gap:10px;height:30px;padding:0 12px;background:var(--s1);border-top:1px solid var(--line-strong)">
      <span class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3)">revenue</span>
      <span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">double</span>
      <span style="width:1px;height:14px;background:var(--line-strong)"></span>
      <span class="mono ell" style="flex:1">9070154776.62</span>
      <span class="row" style="gap:6px;color:var(--accent)"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-panel"/></svg>Inspect row<kbd class="meta" style="border:1px solid var(--accent-line);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;font-family:inherit;margin-left:2px">&#8984;I</kbd></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ---------- 2. open ---------- -->
  <div class="row" style="gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px">
    <span class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3)">2 &nbsp;Open</span>
    <span style="color:var(--fg-2)">&#8984;I slides 460&nbsp;px in over the table, full height of the results pane. Esc closes it.</span>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;width:1160px;height:330px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:26px">
    <table style="border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%">
      <tr style="height:32px">
        <th style="width:52px;background:var(--s1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-right:1px solid var(--line)"></th>
