        </span>
        <span style="color:var(--fg-3)">of 200</span>
        <span style="flex:1"></span>
        <span class="row" style="width:24px;height:24px;justify-content:center;border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg-3)"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></span>
      </div>
      <div class="row" style="gap:8px;height:32px;margin:8px 12px 4px;padding:0 8px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg-3);flex:none">
